    'neutral',
    '{}'::text[],
    ARRAY['bed','sitting']::text[],
    false,
    ARRAY['Start on hands and knees, hands under shoulders and knees under hips.','Breathe in, drop the belly, and lift your chest and tailbone (cow).','Breathe out, push the floor away, and round your back (cat).','Move slowly between them, in a range that feels comfortable.']::text[],
    'Along the back as it rounds and arches. Not a forced stretch.',
    ARRAY['Rushing. Take about 3 seconds each way.','Forcing the end. It should feel like movement, not a hard stretch.','Bending only the neck. Move from the tailbone up through the back.']::text[],
    '3 seconds to arch, 3 seconds to round',
    ARRAY[3,3]::int[],
    'Breathe in as you arch, out as you round.',
    'Pad your knees with a towel, or round and arch seated, hands on your thighs.',
    'Use a slightly larger comfortable range. Do not force the end.',
    'Moves the whole back through rounding and arching, with no load, to loosen it.'
