    ARRAY['sitting','bending','bed']::text[],
    false,
    ARRAY['Lie face down, hands under your shoulders, like the bottom of a push-up.','Relax your hips, buttocks, and legs completely.','Press through your hands to lift your chest. Keep your hips on the floor.','Pause at a comfortable height, then lower slowly.','Stop if pain travels farther into the buttock or down the leg.']::text[],
    'The low back gently extending. Hips and legs stay relaxed on the floor.',
    ARRAY['Squeezing the glutes. Relax them so the low back can extend.','Letting the hips lift. Press up only as high as the hips stay down.','Continuing if pain travels down the leg. Stop and rest.']::text[],
